{"availability":"available","full":"Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch","name":"baiduhotsearch","description":"Real-time Baidu hot-search dashboard (热搜 · 小说 · 电影 · 电视剧) built with Streamlit — one-click refresh with cache & sample-data fallback.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":33,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-14T11:16:51Z","updated":"2026-10-05T14:41:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://baiduhotsearch-d9ysnhxbkzeskrnd5apnn5.streamlit.app/","topics":["baidu","dashboard","data-visualization","hot-search","python","streamlit","trending","web-scraper"],"demo":"https://baiduhotsearch-d9ysnhxbkzeskrnd5apnn5.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.737Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.737Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.737Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.737Z","stars":33,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Domestic buzz · World news · Tech trends — 16 live sources aggregated on one page","Formerly \"Baidu Hot Search\" — a single-board dashboard, now a multi-source trending radar","One board shows you one platform's view — and Baidu's skews entertainment. This project aggregates domestic life trends (Weibo / Zhihu / Douyin / Toutiao / Baidu / Bilibili / Tieba / Tencent News / The Paper), world news in Chinese (Google News / NYT Chinese) and tech circles (Hacker News / GitHub Trending / V2EX / Juejin / Product Hunt) onto a single page, then algorithmically clusters topics that multiple sources are reporting at the same time — when several independent boards hit the same story, that's the news that actually matters."],"features":["🌐 Cross-source board (flagship): title-similarity clustering merges entries about the same event from ≥2 sources, ranked by hit count (ties by a unified composite heat) — tell \"platform noise\" from \"global news\" at a…","🗂️ Three category views: 🇨🇳 Domestic / 🌍 World / 💻 Tech — single source, or a \"mixed stream\" that interleaves all sources by rank","🆕 New / time-on-board badges: SQLite snapshots mark first-seen topics and how long an entry has been trending","🛡️ Three-tier fallback, never blank: live data → 15-min cached snapshot (with age notice) → sample data","🩺 Source diagnostics panel: probes all 16 sources in parallel, reporting availability, item count and latency"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"4360f2926aa200bb39b798c6e0c43120761cafe8a51bf16276078397432612f1","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.948Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.948Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Domestic buzz · World news · Tech trends — 16 live sources aggregated on one page","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"60s API instance: built-in official + community instances with automatic failover; public instances are rate-limited, so you can point to your self-hosted instance (Docker / Node, one-click to Vercel / Zeabur)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Weibo Cookie: paste it once (login weibo.com → F12 → copy the SUB=... from any request header) to go direct to Weibo's official API — works on cloud deploys too; otherwise via 60s API","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-host with a persistent volume to keep it long-term (7 days retained by default).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4360f2926aa200bb39b798c6e0c43120761cafe8a51bf16276078397432612f1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mocas-12/baiduhotsearch/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:55.949Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T14:41:24Z","readme